	<h3>Windows (64-bit)</h3>
	<pre class="cmd">irm https://cone.jondgoodwin.com/install.ps1 | iex</pre>
	<p>Needs Windows 10 or 11, Microsoft's
	<a href="https://visualstudio.microsoft.com/downloads/">C++ Build Tools</a>
	(the installer says how to get them if they are missing) and <a href="https://git-scm.com/downloads">Git</a>.</p>
